egory":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","review_id":"ZIRDBLGyLIg_cJqnsBDFtA","date":"2017-08-30T00:33:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9427588582038879,"text_excerpt":"St. Roch Market is where you go when you have no idea what you want or when you're with a bunch of people who all want different things. There is something that everyone will like! I'm a huge fan of Juice NOLA- their avocado toast is the best I've ever had, and I will order it as long as it's on the menu (no matter how basic I seem). The fresh tomatoes are a really nice touch, and the drizzle of olive oil adds a nice earthiness to it. Oh and the bread! The bread they slather the avocado goodness on is to die for. YUM. I've also gotten the Sue Bird salad from The Good Bird, sans chicken, and it was really yummy. As a lover of butternut squash and goat cheese, this salad was right up my all..."},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","review_id":"MjQcr02QTzp-AGM2LCL5XA","date":"2017-03-26T00:13:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9422047734260559,"text_excerpt":"This place was AWESOME! There is something here for everyone. New Orleans was one of the harder cities to find a place to eat that everyone would agree on but St. Roch Market is perfect for that. The selection is incredible, and it's entirely local places. After spending 10 minutes just deciding on where I wanted to eat, I settled on Fritai because it seemed the most unique, and certainly something I haven't experienced myself. I had the creole chicken sandwich which was delicious! Pretty much everything comes with a side of plantains which were way better than expected. We came here on our last night in New Orleans which I don't recommend, because there were so many places I wanted to co..."},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","review_id":"pvzoTfdBYOEdybKXEjur8Q","date":"2017-06-27T16:50:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9362092018127441,"text_excerpt":"LOVE this place -- highly recommend! It's a food hall with 13 vendors (so it's a great place to go with a group with varied tastes). Food is made-to-order and fresh -- and there are lighter options, which help break up heavy NOLA food that I otherwise often eat when in town. They have an oyster bar, a juice bar, an outpost of Creole Creamery, great sandwiches at Good Bar, a cocktail bar... the list goes on. Plenty of indoor seating. It was very clean and sleek-looking -- it was totally redone after Katrina, and they did an awesome job. There's a small free parking lot next to the market that's for customers only, and we went at lunch time on Sunday and didn't have trouble finding space. I..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","photo_id":"HpdZMkpeJAVKFtzNoRt4Mg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HpdZMkpeJAVKFtzNoRt4Mg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8335561752319336},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","photo_id":"VB6Y8IUUezrkSuCTr22_Bg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/VB6Y8IUUezrkSuCTr22_Bg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8237094879150391},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","photo_id":"l1PSiDVIEc5D5kkdGGt3jQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/l1PSiDVIEc5D5kkdGGt3jQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8098640441894531},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","photo_id":"sepmOrViAnAEkG0UPw-QzA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/sepmOrViAnAEkG0UPw-QzA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8035867810249329},{"business_id":"z0MXYel0okwMqLjgMkKD2A","photo_id":"Cs7k8HsqrfW4loVz7RYO5A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Cs7k8HsqrfW4loVz7RYO5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7900472283363342}]},"notebook_case":null}
